WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.691
Every picture starts with a source.

2
00:00:02.691 --> 00:00:07.697
You can pick one on the start screen, or any time in the Source section of the Controls.

3
00:00:08.158 --> 00:00:09.354
Open the Synth tab.

4
00:00:09.354 --> 00:00:10.803
Source is near the top.

5
00:00:11.254 --> 00:00:14.866
The Pattern Generator makes pictures with no camera at all.

6
00:00:14.866 --> 00:00:17.254
Change its Kind to try another pattern.

7
00:00:17.254 --> 00:00:17.867
Lissajous.

8
00:00:18.323 --> 00:00:18.766
Spiral.

9
00:00:18.766 --> 00:00:19.844
And Worley cells.

10
00:00:19.844 --> 00:00:22.760
Each kind brings its own controls, just below.

11
00:00:23.211 --> 00:00:26.156
To use your own footage, choose a video file.

12
00:00:26.156 --> 00:00:29.952
Webcam, screen capture, and stream URLs work the same way.

13
00:00:30.417 --> 00:00:34.982
The pattern was covering the whole picture, so loading a video switched it off.

14
00:00:34.982 --> 00:00:36.369
This is the video alone.

15
00:00:36.824 --> 00:00:39.712
Turn the pattern back on, and set Blend to Screen.

16
00:00:39.712 --> 00:00:40.984
Now both show through.

17
00:00:41.444 --> 00:00:43.262
Any source can feed the raster.

18
00:00:43.262 --> 00:00:46.372
Next, we will find our way around the Controls panel.
